---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";

const all = await getCollection("work");
const items = all
  .filter((e) => (import.meta.env.PROD ? !e.data.draft : true))
  .sort((a, b) => {
    const ad = a.data.pubDate ? a.data.pubDate.getTime() : 0;
    const bd = b.data.pubDate ? b.data.pubDate.getTime() : 0;
    return bd - ad;
  });
---

<BaseLayout title="Work">
  <h1>Work</h1>
  <p>Selected engagements and execution at enterprise scale.</p>

  {/* === Framing & credibility section === */}
  <section>
    <p>
      I bridge the gap between strategy and enterprise-scale execution, with a strong
      bias toward action and measurable outcomes. My work focuses on designing
      <strong> operating models</strong> — the integrated systems of people, processes,
      governance, and technology that turn ambition into repeatable execution at scale.
    </p>

    <h2>AI transformation — adoption-first execution</h2>

    <p>
      At Nokia, I design the frameworks required to operationalize AI across large
      engineering organizations, moving from fragmented use cases to a managed
      enterprise capability.
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>~45% increase in active usage of AI-supported coding capabilities</li>
      <li>5× increase in AI-enabled specifications and requirements insights in 8 weeks</li>
      <li>~1,160 engineering hours unlocked per week (≈31 engineer-years annually)</li>
      <li>~100:1 return on execution with ~560 hours of non‑BAU effort</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Enterprise transformation — performance operating systems</h2>

    <p>
      Led the rollout of <em>Perform to Win</em>, Nokia’s company-wide shift toward a
      high-performance culture, embedding continuous goal alignment, feedback, and
      performance differentiation as a living operating system.
    </p>

    <h2>Execution foundation</h2>

    <p>
      Grounded in nearly a decade of experience in highly complex, engineering-led
      environments, including custom semiconductor development and large-scale R&D
      programs. Having led 5G processor initiatives, I consistently translate technical
      complexity into operational clarity.
    </p>

    <h2>Advisory & investment work</h2>

    <p>
      Angel investor and advisor (FiBAN), supporting technology founders in translating
      technical roadmaps into scalable business and operating models.
    </p>
  </section>
  
</BaseLayout>